          "text": "Mood and self-esteem"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mood up and down; low self-esteem relating to weight and binge eating. Mildly anxious and tearful at times; affect congruent and low/anxious."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
